---
title: M02 Implemented native disk bootstrap successful path
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as App bootstrap
    participant R as disk registrar
    participant G as Group registry
    participant F as Disk client factory
    participant P as Singleton provider
    participant B as Routes and Bridge
    A->>R: register(typed DiskConfig)
    Note over A,R: Validate config only.<br/>No filesystem I/O.
    R-->>A: PreparedGroup
    A->>G: register(group)
    G-->>A: New typed registry
    Note over A,G: Conflict preserves<br/>original and incoming.
    A->>G: freeze() consumes
    G-->>A: Validate order, Frozen
    A->>G: into_factories()
    G-->>A: DiskFactories tuple
    A->>F: create()
    Note over A,F: First filesystem I/O.<br/>Validate directory.
    F-->>A: Fresh DiskClient
    A->>P: new(ready DiskClient)
    P-->>A: Explicit Rc handle
    A->>A: Inject task and bindings
    A->>B: Register checked routes
    A->>B: Freeze routes, Bridge
    B-->>A: DiskApplication
    Note over A,B: Publish after success.<br/>Singleton path shown.
    Note over F,P: Alternative Transient:<br/>create only on acquire.
